// Generic String :
"P3049152182" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>A simple Halloween tradition - a visit to a haunted house.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>This year, Dr. Kane, a retired scientist and noted recluse, has dared thrillseekers to venture into his dark and mysterious mansion.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>But things are not as they seem in Dr. Kane's house of horror. <t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>Visitors are entering the mansion never to be heard from again...."
// Say String :
"P2329458757" "Come one, come all!"
// Say String :
"P3448095002" "Enter Dr. Kane's House of Horror if you dare!"
// Say String :
"P1667020859" "You'll have the fright of your life!"
// Say String :
"P637279250" "Step inside, we need your flesh!"
// Say String :
"P1655357895" "Are YOU ready for heart-stopping terror?"
// Say String :
"P1013013959" "Hurry inside! We need more limbs!"
// Say String :
"P3637576528" "Step right up! Horror awaits you!"
// Say String :
"P3392383545" "You'll pay to see the whole house, but you'll only use THE GRAVE!"
// Generic String :
"P1442476974" "Enter Dr. Kane's Mansion"
// Say String :
"P981509041" "Anyone who wears a costume for a living may enter free of charge. Go right in."
// Generic String :
"P2004604770" "A dark pact has been made."
// Say String :
"P971607690" "Uhg. I don't feel so good"
// Say String :
"P1748006470" "Prepare yourselves! Our master comes!"
// Generic String :
"P226731702" "The pact has been sealed! The Black Whip comes!"
// Say String :
"P358385649" "I HUNGER!"
// Say String :
"P3998083552" "NOOOOOO!!"
// Generic String :
"P3872493734" "A Dark and Forlorn House"
// Generic String :
"P95610664" "Dr. Kane must be somewhere in this mansion. Locate him and see if he knows anything about the missing guests."
// Say String :
"P564688155" "This place was supposed to be scary! I want to be scared to DEATH!"
// Say String :
"P559723731" "I could spit a better haunted house."
// Say String :
"P393552574" "Hey guys you said this place was scary. I'm NOT scared."
// Say String :
"P2422829111" "Newsflash - haunted house filled with guys in bad zombie costumes."
// Say String :
"P3633490372" "I thought you said you were going to strip the flesh from my bones. Come on, guys, my skin is still here!"
// Say String :
"P2185064615" "Those zombie costumes are SO lame!"
// Say String :
"P2068110532" "What IS the hold up?"
// Generic String :
"P1344029282" "Find Dr. Kane."
// Generic String :
"P3796185770" "<t=7 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=7><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>Thrillseekers line up for their turn to be terrified.<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=8><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>But the smell of blood hangs in the stale air."
// Say String :
"P3745220694" "Oh, great! More costumed freaks just cutting in line. I am SO tired of waiting!"
// Generic String :
"P374943352" "Find Dr. Kane"
// Generic String :
"P3823561485" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>A shrieking voice cries:<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 10><color Crimson><bgcolor Black><i>'What is wrong with the flesh? Is it that it clings to the backs of the living?<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 10><color Crimson><bgcolor Black> All flesh must be taken! The abomination will become more than human!</i>'"
// Generic String :
"P63385012" "The Madman Himself"
// Generic String :
"P3331574841" "Locate Dr. Kane."
// Generic String :
"P2307212731" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>The madman himself, Dr. Kane.<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>His eyes dissect you as a butcher evaluates a side of meat."
// Say String :
"P1002355028" "<scale 1.25>What have we here? More flesh for the taking?</scale>"
// Say String :
"P112618350" "<scale 1.25>Let's have a bit of fun first, shall we? Let me introduce you to my pets....</scale>"
// Generic String :
"P2269460678" "Defeat the Zombies!"
// Generic String :
"P4062373695" "Follow Dr. Kane into the Crypts."
// Generic String :
"P1334640987" "Follow Dr. Kane into the Crypts"
// Generic String :
"P1489385324" "The Madman's Workshop"
// Generic String :
"P1455079111" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>The smell of decay and littered corpses betrays Dr. Kane's dark secret as a defiler of the dead. <t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>But to what end is this madman working?<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>The shuffling of cold, dead feet heralds the walking dead and promises that more of Dr. Kane's horrors await you."
// Generic String :
"P4153489260" "Dr. Kane is Getting Away - Find Him!"
// Generic String :
"P3568500533" "Terror erupts from the foul soil!"
// Generic String :
"P1529002140" "More of Dr. Kane's unholy experiments emerge!"
// Generic String :
"P184550612" "Experiment Number Nine"
// Say String :
"P2459084281" "<scale 1.25>Welcome to my underground lair!</scale>"
// Say String :
"P1302695248" "<scale 1.25>You will make fine playthings for the Abomination...</scale>"
// Say String :
"P3101078191" "<scale 1.25>But first, meet one of my most prized failures. I call him Experiment Number Nine!</scale>"
// Generic String :
"P891903392" "Defeat Experiment Number Nine."
// Generic String :
"P524591475" "Exit the Tomb and Find Dr. Kane."
// Generic String :
"P3052244092" "Experiment Number Nine's Health:"
// Generic String :
"P2334680323" "Boss Health:"
