"P938676149" "The beast roars in pain!"
// Generic String :
"P2437443035" "Exit the Tomb and Find Dr. Kane"
// Generic String :
"P235507155" "The Abomination"
// Generic String :
"P3922450016" "You've got Dr. Kane cornered. Find him and put an end to his vile endeavors."
// Generic String :
